\n\r\nplease find the reproducer here: https://github.com/JayGhiya/QuarkusBugsReproducers/tree/master \r\n\r\nAlso you will find a docker-compose file which starts flink cluster where you can start it so that it receives jar. It throws 400 as \".jar\" is getting removed.\r\n\r\nAlso when switching to vertx web client it works flawlessly with same headers and arguments.\r\n\r\n`protected MultipartForm formMultiPart() {\r\n        MultipartForm multipartForm = MultipartForm.create()\r\n                .binaryFileUpload(\r\n                        \"jarfile\",\r\n                        hl7JarName,\r\n                        System.getProperty(\"user.dir\") + \"/\" + hl7JarName,\r\n                        \"multipart/form-data\");\r\n        LOG.info(\"Prepared the multipart\");\r\n        return multipartForm;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    protected Uni<JarUploadResponse> uploadJar(MultipartForm multipartForm) {\r\n        return client.post(flinkPort, flinkHostIp, \"/jars/upload\")\r\n                .putHeader(\"Content-Type\", \"multipart/form-data\")\r\n                .sendMultipartForm(multipartForm)\r\n                .onItem()\r\n                .transform(\r\n                        bufferHttpResponse -> bufferHttpResponse.bodyAsJson(JarUploadResponse.class)\r\n                )\r\n                .emitOn(Infrastructure.getDefaultWorkerPool());\r\n    }`\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nRestEasy Reactive Multipart client should not have removed the .jar extension.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nRestEasy Reactive Multipart client removes the .jar extension.\n\n### How to Reproduce?\n\nDownload the project from https://github.com/JayGhiya/QuarkusBugsReproducers/tree/master . Import maven project.\r\n\r\nAlso , there will be a docker-compose file.  (docker.io and docker-compose are needed) - Yes i know a wiremock would have been easier but that is still w.i.p .. \r\n\r\nStart the docker-compose file.\r\n\r\nStart the project. \n\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\n\n_No response_\n\n### Output of `java -version`\n\n11\n\n### GraalVM version (if different from Java)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Quarkus version or git rev\n\n_No response_\n\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"michalszynkiewicz","id":3901322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDEzMjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3901322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz","html_url":"https://github.com/michalszynkiewicz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalszynkiewicz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/19805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/19805/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}